    _area: Blocks
    _name: Piece Rotate
    _description: Plays when the falling piece turns (Q, E or Up arrow), only when the turn succeeds.
    _requirements: Short click or swish, under 0.15 s, mono. Gets spammed, so it must not tire the ear.
